{"text": "Alice was not hurt at all, and far ahead she saw the White Rabbit hurrying away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh my ears and whiskers, how late it is getting, it cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Alice ran after it, but when she turned the corner, the Rabbit was gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was in a long, low hall, which was lit by a row of lamps. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were doors all around the hall, but they were all locked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she found a little three legged table that was made of solid glass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a tiny golden key on it, but it was too small for the doors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind a low curtain, she found a little door about fifteen inches high. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She tried the golden key in the lock, and to her great delight, it fitted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The door opened into a small passage, which led to the loveliest garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Alice wanted to go out, but she could not even get her head through the doorway. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh, how I wish I could shut up like a telescope, she said.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "l", "i", "c", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "h", "u", "r", "t", " ", "a", "t", " ", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "a", "r", " ", "a", "h", "e", "a", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "W", "h", "i", "t", "e", " ", "R", "a", "b", "b", "i", "t", " ", "h", "u", "r", "r", "y", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "w", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "h", " ", "m", "y", " ", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "i", "s", "k", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "h", "o", "w", " ", "l", "a", "t", "e", " ", "i", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "g", "e", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "i", "t", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t",